{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> of the accompanying diagram, line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/783d500281f8f46167dff3b071c543d42150e67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DP$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> is drawn bisecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and meeting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> (extended) at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. From vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c4513c51b21ded24a893c497f1c571a10e1b69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is drawn bisecting side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and meeting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> (extended) at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />. Lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/783d500281f8f46167dff3b071c543d42150e67f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DP$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c4513c51b21ded24a893c497f1c571a10e1b69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> meet at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. If the area of parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, then the area of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e736d0f51b1d918745d32fab7e41c07ce04f8107.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QPO$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> is equal to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e5cd7b8c56d1533436642a2a9c670adfb2257f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size((400)); draw((0,0)--(5,0)--(6,3)--(1,3)--cycle); draw((6,3)--(-5,0)--(10,0)--(1,3)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (0,0), S); label(&quot;B&quot;, (5,0), S); label(&quot;C&quot;, (6,3), NE); label(&quot;D&quot;, (1,3), NW); label(&quot;P&quot;, (10,0), E); label(&quot;Q&quot;, (-5,0), W); label(&quot;M&quot;, (.5,1.5), NW); label(&quot;N&quot;, (5.65, 1.5), NE); label(&quot;O&quot;, (3.4,1.75));[/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"168\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32ff871e6741a668fc1f29c9e548a1de256ed1ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } k \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{6k}{5} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{9k}{8} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\frac{5k}{4} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"395\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc3a4ae336c23b516f5b6d481fd37daab5e97959.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[QPO]=[QAM]+[PBN]+[AMONB]=[AMONB]+[MDC]+[NCD]\\]\" width=\"561\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/4/3c47a931e262e12ea992c19d04df87a85ee85df6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=[AMONB]+[MDC]+[NOC]+[DOC]=[ABCD]+[DOC]=k+[DOC].\\]\" width=\"586\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Also, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a62ea3f6144a43dd1056cf6f00fb7d4283418b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DCNM$\" width=\"65\" height=\"12\" /> is a parallelogram, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d68ec48c7ea63c15e66140ac0025c9b53c87c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[DOC]=\\frac{1}{4}[DCNM]=\\frac{1}{8}[ABCD]=\\frac{k}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"310\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa301a69fb1aeb8a3355c9fb067002b0babbf67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[QPO]=k+\\frac{k}{8}=\\frac{9k}{8}, \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"202\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"197